[PrintTextModified Text:我决定仔细调查下垃圾滑槽。|#0202Bad01_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（事前检查一定要做好。<br>　谁也不知道会出什么意外）|#0202Bad01_Hiro001|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我小心翼翼地掀开沉重的铁盖，<br>注意不破坏设好的陷阱。|#0202Bad01_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:往里面一看，冰冷的风便透过管道吹了上来。|#0202Bad01_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（……里面太黑了，看不清啊）|#0202Bad01_Hiro002| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:为了看得清楚些，我又把身子往前探了探<br>——就在这时。|#0202Bad01_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

