[PrintTextModified Text:环顾周围——只见自己身在惩罚室当中。|#0202Bad01_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_20_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Pensive

[PrintTextModified Text:怎、怎么回事……？这里是，惩罚室……？|#0202Bad01_Hiro006| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:"（我是掉下去摔死了吗……？<br>　不对，那我应该在牢房的床上醒来）|#0202Bad01_Hiro007|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:从那么长的管道里摔下来，<br>我的身上却没留下任何伤痛。|#0202Bad01_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:而且，那条管道明明通向焚烧炉。|#0202Bad01_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（到底发生了什么事……？）|#0202Bad01_Hiro008| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我迷茫地左右看了看惩罚室，<br>异样的感觉愈发明显。|#0202Bad01_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@SpawnBlur ActorId:MainBackground Intensity:1

[PrintTextModified Text:墙壁是扭曲的，不对，<br>就连这里的空气、整个世界都是扭曲的。|#0202Bad01_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（可能是我的魔法影响了整个监牢，<br>　导致这里出现了奇异的现象吧）|#0202Bad01_Hiro009|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（看来只能先调查一下了）|#0202Bad01_Hiro010| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:正当我走向门口的时候，<br>房门却被谁猛地打开了。|#0202Bad01_Narrative014| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

